{
  "about": [
    "A Window Habit's cooldown options, written as data: which units a Habit of each window kind may",
    "count a cooldown in, and the longest cooldown each takes.",
    "",
    "Both evaluators replay it. `src-tauri/tests/operations/cooldown_conformance.rs` runs every case",
    "through `CooldownUnit::allowed_for` and `Cooldown::longest` \u2014 the bound `Cooldown::fits` refuses",
    "past; `src/utils/cooldown-conformance.test.ts` runs them through the Flow editor's",
    "`cooldownKinds` and `maxCooldown`, which bound the field as you type. Neither side generates",
    "this file.",
    "",
    "`units` lists, for each window kind, the units finer than it, in the order the editor offers",
    "them; a sub-day or exact window takes none. A case names a window of `habitN` \u00d7 `habitKind`, a",
    "unit, and the longest cooldown in it that cannot reach the end of the window after the one it",
    "follows. See `docs/spec/habits.md`, *Cooldown*."
